      "title": "Paired-selector refinement and simultaneous coarse-spectrum preservation are distinct",
      "body": "For selectors c,d, the paired selector has terminal kernel K_(c,d)=K_c intersection K_d and spectrum U(K_c intersection K_d). Requiring compatibility with both original coarse quotients instead gives U(K_c) intersection U(K_d), the unit system modulo lcm of their resonance radicals; these can differ strictly.",
